---

## 🎯 Learning Objective

This practice test was designed to demonstrate the ability to:

1. Enter and organize data in Excel.
2. Clean an imperfect dataset.
3. Apply Excel functions to calculate KPIs.
4. Calculate basic performance rates.
5. Interpret analytical results.
6. Connect information across worksheets.
7. Create a simple analytical dashboard.
8. Present findings using a chart.

